<DataValueMember Name="DN" DataType="BOOL" Value="0"/>
</Structure>
</Data>
</Tag>
</Tags>
<Routines>
<Routine Name="MainRoutine" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[
All information provided  - No Warranty or implied merchantability. 
Refer to the RSLogix 5000 End User License Agreement (EULA) in the Release Notes

]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[NOP();]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[When DriveOn_Button or Autocycle_Button is enabled turn on axis_x servo loop (drive enable is set and positon and velocity loop are closed). axis_x.ServoActStatus will be set when servo loop is enabled.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(DriveOn_Button) ,XIC(Autocycle_Button) ]XIO(axis_x.ServoActionStatus)MSO(axis_x,Axis_xMSO);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="2" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[When the DriveOff_Button is enabled turn axis_x servo off. Reset all axis faults for axis_x and axis_y, and reset from axis_x shutdown state.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(Autocycle_Button)XIC(DriveOff_Button)[[[MAFR(axis_x,Axis_xMAFR) ,MAFR(axis_y,Axis_yMAFR) ] ,MASR(axis_x,Axis_xMASR) ] ,XIC(Axis_xMAFR.DN) MSF(axis_x,Axis_xMSF) ];]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="3" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[When the HomeMotor_Button is enabled home axis_x. The homing sequence is defined during axis configuration. To see home configuration parameters for axis_x select the box next to axis_x in the MAH instruction. Select HOMING tab to review information]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(Autocycle_Button)XIC(HomeMotor_Button)MAH(axis_x,Axis_xMAH);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="4" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Jog axis_x forward when the JogFwd_Button is enabled.  The speed of the jog is 5 units/sec (revs/sec), the acceleration and deceleration are 50% of maximum, and the jog profile type is trapezoidal. To see axis units and max acceleration and deceleration launch axis_x configuration dialog by selecting the box next to axis_x in the MAH instruction. Select UNITS and DYNAMICS tab to review information.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(JogFwd_Button)MAJ(axis_x,Axis_xMAJ,Forward,5,Units per sec,50,% of Maximum,50,% of Maximum,Trapezoidal,100.0,100.0,% of Time,Disabled,Programmed,0,None);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="5" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Jog axis_x reverse when the JogRev_button is enabled.  The speed of the jog is 50% of max, the acceleration and deceleration and 50% of maximum, and the jog profile type is trapezoidal.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(JogRev_Button)MAJ(axis_x,Axis_xMAJR,1,5,Units per sec,50,% of Maximum,50,% of Maximum,Trapezoidal,100.0,100.0,% of Time,Disabled,Programmed,0,None);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="6" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Stop axis_x jog move with the JogRev_Button or JogRev_Button is released. axis_x will decel to a stop at a rate of 50% of max decel.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(JogRev_Button)XIO(JogFwd_Button)MAS(axis_x,Axis_xMAS,Jog,No,50,% of Maximum,Yes,100.0,% of Time);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="7" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Enable gearing when the Gearing_Button, GearRatioUp_Button or GearRatioDn_button is enabled by calling the MAG instruction. axis_x will be geared to axis_y actual position at a ratio specified by the tag gear_ratio. The value of gear_ratio is set by the GearRatioUp_Button andGearRatioDn_Button and will range from 0 to 10. Clutch on the MAG instruction is enabled so if axis_y is moving axis_x will rampup to the proper speed using accel rate of 70% of maximum before locking on. Gearing can be active at the same time jog (MAJ) or autocycle (MAM incremental moves) are active.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[[XIC(GearRatioUp_Button) ONS(storage_bits.0) LEQ(gear_ratio,9.5) ADD(gear_ratio,0.5,gear_ratio) ,[XIC(GearRatioDn_Button) ONS(storage_bits.1) GEQ(gear_ratio,0.5) SUB(gear_ratio,0.5,gear_ratio) ,XIC(Gearing_Button) ] ]MAG(axis_x,axis_y,MAGear,1,gear_ratio,1,1,Actual,Real,Enabled,70,% of Maximum);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="8" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Read axis_x and axis_y actual position and store to tag Axis_xPos and Axis_yPos.  axis_x and axis_y actual position can be monitored or used in the application program by using the Axis_xPos and axis_yPos tags.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[GSV(AXIS,axis_y,ActualPosition,Axis_yPos)GSV(AXIS,axis_x,ActualPosition,Axis_xPos);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="9" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Jump to MotionAuto routine. ]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[JSR(MotionAuto,0);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
<Routine Name="MotionAuto" Type="RLL">
<RLLContent>
<Rung Number="0" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Read Analog_In_Ch0, add 5 and store in tag SPEED. SPEED will vary from 5 to 15 depending on value of Analog_In_Ch0. SPEED is used in the MAM move calls in rung 1.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Autocycle_Button)ADD(Analog_In_Ch0,5,Speed);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Number="1" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Move axis_X incremental distance forward of 5 revs (MAM), dwell .5seconds, move axis_X incremental distance of - 5 revs (MAM), dwell .5 seconds. Repeat cycle as long as Autocycle_Button is enabled. Speed of incremental moves is specified by  tag SPEED in units/sec (revs/sec), profile type is Trapezoidal, acceleration and deceleration are 10% of maximum.]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Autocycle_Button)XIC(Axis_xMSO.DN)XIO(Step2_delay.DN)MAM(axis_x,Axis_xMAM1,1,100,Speed,Units per sec,10,% of Maximum,10,% of Maximum,Trapezoidal,100.0,100.0,% of Time,Disabled,Programmed,0,None,0,0)XIC(Axis_xMAM1.PC)TON(Step1_delay,?,?)XIC(Step1_delay.DN)MAM(axis_x,Axis_xMAM2,1,-100,Speed,Units per sec,10,% of Maximum,10,% of Maximum,Trapezoidal,100.0,100.0,% of Time,Disabled,Programmed,0,None,0,0)XIC(Axis_xMAM2.PC)TON(Step2_delay,?,?);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
</Routines>
</Program>
</Programs>
<Tasks>
<Task Name="MainTask" Type="CONTINUOUS" Priority="10" Watchdog="500" DisableUpdateOutputs="false" InhibitTask="false">
<ScheduledPrograms>
<ScheduledProgram Name="MainProgram"/>
</ScheduledPrograms>
</Task>
</Tasks>
